@@ -0,0 +1,9 @@
+# Jeffy loop state files. Prettier's proseWrap "never" joins the labelled
+# lines of PLAN.md's Verify command block into one paragraph and rewrites
+# __tests__ as **tests**, which destroys the grammar the Stop hook and the
+# verify wrapper parse. These files are machine-read, not prose.
+PLAN.md
+BACKLOG.md
+JOURNAL.md
+JOURNAL-archive.md
+.jeffy/
